<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico net reserves, assets rise.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico net reserves, assets rise.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico said on Tuesday its international reserves as of April 25 were $21.718 billion, compared to $20.903 billion on April 18.</p>
<p>The central bank said that its net international assets as of the same date rose to $12.433 billion from $11.414 billion the week before.</p>
